[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8040.95, "timestamp": "02:14:00", "text": "基于摄像头的 AR 特效，比如在你的脸上实现这种效果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8043.109, "timestamp": "02:14:03", "text": "。 所以，这实际上就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8045.99, "timestamp": "02:14:05", "text": "对他的脸部进行屏幕捕捉或窗口捕捉之"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8049.589, "timestamp": "02:14:09", "text": "类的操作，对吧？ 看到了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8051.99, "timestamp": "02:14:11", "text": "呃，《"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8054.069, "timestamp": "02:14:14", "text": "Among Us》在哪儿？ 我想向"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8061.109, "timestamp": "02:14:21", "text": "对，就是这个。 如果有人被"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8063.35, "timestamp": "02:14:23", "text": "禁言或封禁，你就会看到那个"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 8064.463, "timestamp": "02:14:24", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ohh"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8065.109, "timestamp": "02:14:25", "text": "提示。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8068.069, "timestamp": "02:14:28", "text": "等等，等等。 我们等他来做吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8071.91, "timestamp": "02:14:31", "text": "是的，有人被封号了。   你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8075.27, "timestamp": "02:14:35", "text": "看，你也可以做这样的事。 它太有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8078.47, "timestamp": "02:14:38", "text": "创新性了，是的，你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8082.149, "timestamp": "02:14:42", "text": "用 Insami 之类的东西做到这一点。 此外，Nati"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8085.669, "timestamp": "02:14:45", "text": "也制作了很多教程。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8087.99, "timestamp": "02:14:47", "text": "Nati制作了很多关于这些东西的教程，她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8093.51, "timestamp": "02:14:53", "text": "也是一名OBS创作者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8095.75, "timestamp": "02:14:55", "text": "好多教程之类的东西，真"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 8096.755, "timestamp": "02:14:56", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT